ProgressUpdate.description:
A time-series health/value update on a goal or target. Goal-parented
updates do not require a `value` (they record health pulses only);
target-parented updates require a `value`.

status.description:
Current AASM state. Draft is the initial state;
`proposed_outside_meeting` is the shortcut-path circulation state;
`escalated` is queued for live meeting; `accepted` is terminal.
